    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. After an enemy finishes firing in the opponent’s [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), pick one of your World Eaters Rhino models hit by the attacker and still on one wound or more. Pick a single embarked Khorne Berzerkers unit in that Rhino. It can get out via a [Disembark move](vsdata:core-rule/disembark-move), then follow up with a [Surge move](vsdata:core-rule/surge-move). The second move has a D6+2″ cap. A unit cannot receive both Fury Unleashed and [Unrelenting Advance](vsdata:ability/world-eaters.goretrack-onslaught.unrelenting-advance) during one phase.",
